'''Theatre of Blood Master''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood]] 75 times. [[Theatre of Blood/Hard Mode|Hard Mode Theatre of Blood]] completions will also count towards this achievement.

